cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Thundering Waters: The Toxic Legacy of Niagara County"
message: "If you use this dataset or map, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: McShane
    given-names: Caitlin
repository-code: "https://github.com/C-McShane/Thundering-Waters"
url: "https://c-mcshane.github.io/Thundering-Waters/web/map.html"
abstract: >-
  An interactive documentary map of hazardous and radioactive contamination in
  Niagara County, New York. Compiles NYSDEC site records, monitoring-well and
  soil chemistry digitised from remedial investigation reports, radiological
  survey results, and NYSDOH block-group cancer incidence (2011-2015). Sample
  points are individually searchable by identifier so any cited figure can be
  independently verified against its source report. Inspired by Christen
  Civiletto's book.
keywords:
  - environmental contamination
  - Niagara County
  - Superfund
  - FUSRAP
  - radiological survey
  - groundwater monitoring
  - cancer incidence
  - open data
